flowchart TB
  Host[宿主设置用例] --> Service[AgentModelDiscoveryService]
  Service --> Settings[通用连接配置端口]
  Service --> Registry[冻结能力目录与作用域租约]
  Service --> Access[库访问租约与资源所有权]
  Registry --> Provider[AgentModelDiscoveryProvider]
  Provider --> HTTP[HTTP 发现模块]
  Provider --> Custom[其他共享或平台发现模块]
  HTTP --> Transport[凭据读取与实际 HTTP 传输]
  HTTP --> Advice[有界模型标识与显示名称]
  Custom --> Advice
  Advice --> Service
  Service --> Result[携带原连接快照的建议结果]
  Result --> Host
